  "title": "Vertiv and 451 Research Release New Report on 5G Preparedness and Technical Enablers",
  "summary": "Vertiv, together with technology analyst firm 451 Research, today released the report on the state of 5G, “Telco Study Reveals Industry Hopes and Fears: From Energy Costs to Edge Computing Transformation.” The report captures the results of an in-depth survey of more than 100 global telecom decision makers with visibility into 5G and edge strategies and plans.",
